units metal
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 4.05
region box block 0 5 0 5 0 5
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
pair_style hybrid/overlay metatomic_1 pet-mad-latest.pt device cuda non_conservative on scale 1.0 metatomic_2 pet-mad-latest.pt device cuda non_conservative on scale -1.0 metatomic_3 pet-mad-latest.pt device cuda non_conservative off scale 1.0
pair_coeff * * metatomic_1 13
pair_coeff * * metatomic_2 13
pair_coeff * * metatomic_3 13
run_style respa 2 8 hybrid 1 2 2
mass 1 26.981539
velocity all create 300.0 12345 mom no dist gaussian
neighbor 2.0 bin
timestep 0.032
thermo 1
fix 1 all nve
run 100
